# Storyteller Studio environment variables
#
# This project currently does not require any secrets to run locally.
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and add values only if you wire up
# integrations (e.g. Lovable Cloud / Supabase, AI providers).
#
# NEVER commit real secrets. `.env` and `.env.local` are gitignored.

# Example placeholders (uncomment and fill in if needed):
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=your-project-url
# VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-anon-publishable-key
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here